# 3DUI

Before adding or changing a 3DUI primitive, read `src/app/3DUI/instructions.md` and follow it.

- Work only in `src/app/3DUI/_lib/<your-primitive>/`.
- CSS extrusion first. GLB only when a box cannot represent the silhouette or bevel.
- GLB extras must use the `ui3d` recipe format. Serve meshes from `public/3dui/`. Carousel is CSS block buttons, not a moulded mesh.
- Append one entry to `src/app/library/page.tsx`. Do not restyle the viewer or edit sibling primitives.
- Keep motion small; pivot at the geometric center.
- When converting multiple 2D buttons, wrap them in `Button3DGroup` (or pass distinct `tilt={n}`). Each button must have a different resting tilt.
